  <p class="docs-lead">A cross-platform C++ driver for streaming color,
  infrared, and depth over USB 3.0, with color-to-depth registration and
  accelerated processing pipelines including Metal on Apple Silicon.</p>
  <div class="docs-actions">
    <a class="primary-button" href="getting_started.html">Start building</a>
    <a class="docs-secondary-button" href="guides.html">Browse every guide</a>
  </div>
</div>
@endhtmlonly

@warning This project supports the **Kinect for Windows v2** sensor (K4W2),
not Kinect v1 or Xbox 360 sensors. If you are unsure which hardware you have,
start with @ref kinect_v1_vs_v2.

